      "number": 42,
      "pali": "paṭinissaggāya ime tayo dhammā bhāvetabbā”ti. ",
      "english": "For the letting go of negligence, these three things should be developed.” "
    },
    {
      "number": 43,
      "pali": "Idamavoca bhagavā. ",
      "english": "That is what the Buddha said. "
    },
    {
      "number": 44,
      "pali": "Attamanā te bhikkhū bhagavato bhāsitaṁ abhinandunti. ",
      "english": "Satisfied, the mendicants approved what the Buddha said. "
    },
    {
      "number": 45,
      "pali": "Rāgapeyyālaṁ niṭṭhitaṁ. ",
      "english": ""
    },
